msgid "Email server (listmonk)"
msgstr "Поштовий сервер (listmonk)"

#: .\console\templates\console\backend_settings.html:77
msgid ""
"Point Town Hall at your listmonk server. Which emails are sent, and with "
"which templates, is set in Communication &gt; Email. Without a server, "
"emails are printed in the server console instead (useful for testing)."
msgstr ""
"Вкажіть Town Hall свій сервер listmonk. Які листи надсилаються і з якими "
